1yta|n|One who keeps a constant watch of the conduct of others. ; A person sent secretly into an enemy's camp, territory, or fortifications, to inspect his works, ascertain his strength, movements, or designs, and to communicate such intelligence to the proper officer.	N:22qq,110,4~22qq,110,4
